From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Playport <dev@playport.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 22:49:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: give a WoW64 window's PEB32 the debug channel table

i386 ntdll reads its debug channels at PEB32 plus one page, as the native
one reads them at PEB plus two. PEB32 is fresh storage in the window, so
the guest saw no channel and a default of 0: every i386 err and fixme was
silent. Copy the owner's table there at reservation, terminator (the
default flags) included, bounded by the PEB32 view.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-03-portal2-wow64-pointers.md
Offered-upstream: no; the window exists only on the iOS port
---
 build/ntdll-unix/virtual_ios.c | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/ntdll-unix/virtual_ios.c b/build/ntdll-unix/virtual_ios.c
index 25f0a70..96cc242 100644
--- a/build/ntdll-unix/virtual_ios.c
+++ b/build/ntdll-unix/virtual_ios.c
@@ -15633,6 +15633,17 @@ static NTSTATUS ios_wow64_reserve_window( void *owner )
             ios_wow64_delete_views( base );
             goto unlock_virtual;
         }
+        {
+            /* i386 ntdll reads its debug channels at PEB32 + one page, as the
+             * native one does at PEB + two (a child's copy, loader_ios.c);
+             * the terminator holds the default flags. */
+            struct dbg_channel { unsigned char flags; char name[15]; };
+            const struct dbg_channel *src = (const struct dbg_channel *)((char *)owner + 0x2000);
+            unsigned int nb = 0, max = (host_page_mask + 1 - 0x1000) / sizeof(*src) - 1;
+            while (nb < max && src[nb].name[0]) nb++;
+            memcpy( (char *)ios_wow64_windows[slot].peb32 + 0x1000, src, (nb + 1) * sizeof(*src) );
+            dprintf( 2, "[wow64-window] PEB32 debug channels: %u, default flags %#x\n", nb, src[nb].flags );
+        }
         ios_wow64_alias_session_view( base, user_shared_data, 0x7ffe0000, "KUSER_SHARED_DATA" );
         if ((ios_wow64_windows[slot].peb32->GdiDCAttributeList =
              ios_wow64_alias_dc_attr( base, ios_wow64_dc_attr_create() )))
